  howpublished = {ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM)},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：AffectiveArt Challenge 2026：艺术图像中的细粒度情感理解与生成},
  abstract = {Recent advances in AI-generated content and multimodal foundation models have substantially improved visual generation and image understanding, yet current systems still struggle with fine-grained emotional expression in artistic imagery. To address this limitation, we organized the AffectiveArt 2026 Challenge, built upon the EmoArt dataset and comprising two complementary tracks: Track 1: Emotion-Aware Artistic Image Generation, which evaluates semantically, stylistically, and emotionally aligned image synthesis; and Track 2: Multidimensional Art Emotion Understanding, which evaluates fine-grained affect recognition and attribute-level visual explanation. This paper presents the challenge design, the evaluation protocol, the official results, the best performing methods, and the organizational experience. AffectiveArt 2026 provides a benchmark and practical foundation for advancing emotion-aware artistic generation and interpretable art emotion understanding.},
